# C++-level conservative shadow-scanner recall self-test
# (SimpleMarkSweepGC::runScannerRecallSelfTest):
# each case keeps an alive-but-unrooted object referenced ONLY as a raw
# Obj*, as NaN-tagged (plain/const/weak) stack words, or from a callee-
# saved register, forces a collection, and asserts the shadow scanner
# flagged the object the precise mark missed.  Verdict prints on stdout;
# the case summary prints on stderr and is shape-checked by
# gc_scanner_selftest.err.
_runtests('gc_scanner')
